n  42 \\n  43 ### 6. Secrets Configuration\\n  44 Add these secrets in Settings → Secrets → Actions:\\n  45 - [ ] `WORDPRESS_API_URL`\\n  46 - [ ] `OPENAI_API_KEY`\\n  47 - [ ] `STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`\\n  48 - [ ] `SITE_URL`\\n  49 - [ ] `SITE_NAME`\\n  50 - [ ] `SITE_DESCRIPTION`\\n  51 \\n  52 ### 7. First Deployment\\n  53 - [ ] Push to main branch\\n  54 - [ ] Check Actions tab for build progress\\n  55 - [ ] Wait for deployment (2-5 minutes)\\n  56 - [ ] Visit your GitHub Pages URL\\n  57 \\n  58 ## Post-Deployment\\n  59 \\n  60 ### 8. Verification\\n  61 - [ ] Site loads correctly\\n  62 - [ ] Blog posts display\\n  63 - [ ] Images load properly\\n  64 - [ ] Links work\\n  65 - [ ] AI tools functional (if configured)\\n  66 - [ ] Mobile responsive\\n  67 - [ ] Dark mode works\\n  68 \\n  69 ### 9. SEO Setup\\n  70 - [ ] Submit sitemap to Google Search Console\\n  71 - [ ] Submit sitemap to Bing Webmaster\\n  72 - [ ] Verify robots.txt accessible\\n  73 - [ ] Test Open Graph tags (use opengraph.xyz)\\n  74 - [ ] Test Twitter Cards (use cards-dev.twitter.com)\\n  75 \\n  76 ### 10. Analytics (Optional)\\n  77 - [ ] Add Google Analytics\\n  78 - [ ] Add Facebook Pixel\\n  79 - [ ] Set up Google Search Console\\n  80 - [ ] Configure Bing Webmaster Tools\\n  81 \\n  82 ### 11. Monetization Setup\\n  83 - [ ] Test donation widget\\n  84 - [ ] Add affiliate IDs\\n  85 - [ ] Test affiliate links\\n  86 - [ ] Verify disclosure notices\\n  87 \\n  88 ### 12. Performance\\n  89 - [ ] Run Lighthouse audit (target: 90+)\\n  90 - [ ] Test Core Web Vitals\\n  91 - [ ] Check mobile performance\\n  92 - [ ] Verify image optimization\\n  93 \\n  94 ## Go Live\\n  95 \\n  96 ### 13. Final Steps\\n  97 - [ ] Switch Stripe to live mode (when ready)\\n  98 - [ ] Update social media profiles\\n  99 - [ ] Announce launch\\n 100 - [ ] Share first post\\n 101 - [ ] Monitor analytics\\n 102 \\n 103 ## Maintenance\\n 104 \\n 105 ### 14. Regular Tasks\\n 106 - [ ] Weekly: Check for broken links\\n 107 - [ ] Monthly: Update dependencies (`npm update`)\\n 108 - [ ] Monthly: Review analytics\\n 109 - [ ] Quarterly: Update content\\n 110 - [ ] As needed: Respond to issues\\n 111 \\n 112 ---\\n 113 \\n 114 **Ready to deploy? Start checking boxes! ☑️**\\n 115 \\n````","Successfully opened .github/workflows/deploy.yml:\\n\\n````yaml\\n   0 name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\\n   1 \\n   2 on:\\n   3   push:\\n   4     branches:\\n   5       - main\\n   6   workflow_dispatch:\\n   7 \\n   8 permissions:\\n   9   contents: read\\n  10   pages: write\\n  11   id-token: write\\n  12 \\n  13 concurrency:\\n  14   group: \\"pages\\"\\n  15   cancel-in-progress: false\\n  16 \\n  17 jobs:\\n  18   build:\\n  19     runs-on: ubuntu-latest\\n  20     steps:\\n  21       - name: Checkout\\n  22         uses: actions/checkout@v4\\n  23 \\n  24       - name: Setup Node\\n  25         uses: actions/setup-node@v4\\n  26         with:\\n  27           node-version: \'20\'\\n  28           cache: \'npm\'\\n  29 \\n  30       - name: Setup Pages\\n  31         uses: actions/configure-pages@v4\\n  32         with:\\n  33           static_site_generator: next\\n  34 \\n  35       - name: Restore cache\\n  36         uses: actions/cache@v3\\n  37         with:\\n  38           path: |\\n  39             .next/cache\\n  40           key: ${{ runner.os }}-nextjs-${{ hashFiles(\'**/package-lock.json\') }}-${{ hashFiles(\'**.[jt]s\', \'**.[jt]sx\') }}\\n  41           restore-keys: |\\n  42             ${{ runner.os }}-nextjs-${{ hashFiles(\'**/package-lock.json\') }}-\\n  43 \\n  44       - name: Install dependencies\\n  45         run: npm ci\\n  46 \\n  47       - name: Build with Next.js\\n  48         run: npm run build\\n  49         env:\\n  50           NEXT_PUBLIC_WORDPRESS_API_URL: ${{ secrets.WORDPRESS_API_URL }}\\n  51           OPENAI_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.OPENAI_API_KEY }}\\n  52           NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: ${{ secrets.STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY }}\\n  53           NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL: ${{ secrets.SITE_URL }}\\n  54           NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME: ${{ secrets.SITE_NAME }}\\n  55           NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_DESCRIPTION: ${{ secrets.SITE_DESCRIPTION }}\\n  56 \\n  57       - name: Upload artifact\\n  58         uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\\n  59         with:\\n  60           path: ./out\\n  61 \\n  62   deploy:\\n  63     environment:\\n  64       name: github-pages\\n  65       url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\\n  66     runs-on: ubuntu-latest\\n  67     needs: build\\n  68     steps:\\n  69       - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\\n  70         id: deployment\\n  71         uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\\n  72 \\n````"]'}
