2026-02-03 08:52:17.905 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "create_file", "args": "{\"file_path\": \"scripts/backup.sh\", \"initial_content\": \"#!/bin/bash\\nset -e\\n\\n# Backup script for Clawbot deployment\\n\\nBACKUP_DIR=\\\"/backups\\\"\\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)\\nBACKUP_FILE=\\\"clawbot_backup_${TIMESTAMP}.tar.gz\\\"\\n\\necho \\\"\ud83d\udcbe Creating Backup\\\"\\necho \\\"==================\\\"\\necho \\\"\\\"\\n\\n# Create backup directory\\nmkdir -p $BACKUP_DIR\\n\\ncd /root/app 2>/dev/null || cd .\\n\\n# Backup application data and configuration\\necho \\\"\ud83d\udce6 Backing up application...\\\"\\ntar -czf ${BACKUP_DIR}/${BACKUP_FILE} \\\\\\n    --exclude='node_modules' \\\\\\n    --exclude='.next' \\\\\\n    --exclude='.git' \\\\\\n    .env \\\\\\n    docker-compose.yml \\\\\\n    nginx.conf \\\\\\n    ssl/\\n\\necho \\\"\u2705 Backup created: ${BACKUP_DIR}/${BACKUP_FILE}\\\"\\necho \\\"\\\"\\n\\n# Keep only last 7 backups\\necho \\\"\ud83e\uddf9 Cleaning old backups (keeping last 7)...\\\"\\ncd $BACKUP_DIR\\nls -t clawbot_backup_*.tar.gz | tail -n +8 | xargs -r rm\\n\\necho \\\"\\\"\\necho \\\"\ud83d\udcca Available backups:\\\"\\nls -lh $BACKUP_DIR/clawbot_backup_*.tar.gz 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"No backups found\\\"\\necho \\\"\\\"\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01F2DxuFFFnDvARSELgvwADY", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
