ecord)\n4. **Enable SSL**:\n   ```bash\n   ssh root@YOUR_IP\n   cd /root/app\n   bash scripts/setup-ssl.sh yourdomain.com\n   ```\n\n## Useful Commands\n\n```bash\n# View logs\nssh root@YOUR_IP 'cd /root/app && docker compose logs -f'\n\n# Restart services\nssh root@YOUR_IP 'cd /root/app && docker compose restart'\n\n# Monitor system\nssh root@YOUR_IP 'bash /root/app/scripts/monitor.sh'\n\n# Update app\nssh root@YOUR_IP 'bash /root/app/scripts/update.sh'\n\n# Backup\nssh root@YOUR_IP 'bash /root/app/scripts/backup.sh'\n```\n\n## Cost\n\n- **Server**: €5.83/month (CX22 - 2 vCPU, 4GB RAM)\n- **Storage**: €0.50/month (10GB volume)\n- **Total**: ~€6.33/month\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Can't connect to server?**\n```bash\n# Check server status in Hetzner console\n# Wait 2-3 minutes after deployment\n```\n\n**Site not loading?**\n```bash\nssh root@YOUR_IP\ndocker compose ps  # Check if services are running\ndocker compose logs app  # Check logs\n```\n\n**Need help?**\nSee full guide: `HETZNER_DEPLOYMENT.md`\n\n---\n\n**That's it! Your Clawbot is live! 🎉**\n", 'tool_response': 'Successfully replaced code in QUICK_DEPLOY_HETZNER.md:\n\n--- QUICK_DEPLOY_HETZNER.md\n+++ QUICK_DEPLOY_HETZNER.md\n@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@\n    - Projects → Your Project → Security → API Tokens\n    - Generate new token → Copy it\n \n-2. **Get Anthropic API Key (for Clawbot)**\n+2. **Get Anthropic API Key (for OpenClaw Moltbot)**\n    - Go to https://console.anthropic.com/\n    - Settings → API Keys\n    - Create Key → Copy it\n', 'logfire.scrubbed': '[{"path": ["attributes", "tool_arguments", "find"], "matched_substring": "API Key"}, {"path": ["attributes", "tool_arguments", "replace"], "matched_substring": "API Key"}]'}
