2026-02-03 09:18:56.279 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "create_file", "args": "{\"file_path\": \".env.example.openclaw\", \"initial_content\": \"# OpenClaw Moltbot Environment Variables\\n# Copy this to .env on your server or local development\\n\\n# WordPress Configuration\\nWORDPRESS_API_URL=https://your-wordpress-site.com/wp-json\\n\\n# AI API Keys\\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\\n\\n# OpenClaw Configuration\\n# Get your API key from: https://openclaw.ai\\nOPENCLAW_API_KEY=your-openclaw-api-key-here\\nOPENCLAW_API_URL=https://api.openclaw.ai\\n\\n# Site Configuration\\nSITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com\\nSITE_NAME=My AI Blog\\nSITE_DESCRIPTION=AI-powered content platform with OpenClaw Moltbot\\n\\n# Monetization (Optional)\\nSTRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...\\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...\\n\\n# Node Environment\\nNODE_ENV=production\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01W51b3f589Rup8UyvoGfFQu", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
