2026-02-03 09:19:43.232 | DEBUG    | Model request part: {"tool_name": "expand_code_chunks", "content": "Successfully expanded code chunks in HETZNER_DEPLOYMENT.md:\n\n````markdown\n   0 # \ud83e\udd16 OpenClaw Moltbot Hetzner Cloud Deployment Guide\n   1 \n   2 Complete guide for deploying your AI-powered blog platform on Hetzner Cloud with Claude (OpenClaw Moltbot) integration.\n   3 \n   4 ## \ud83d\udccb Prerequisites\n   5 \n   6 1. **Hetzner Cloud Account**\n   7    - Sign up at https://www.hetzner.com/cloud\n   8    - Generate API token in Cloud Console \u2192 Security \u2192 API Tokens\n   9 \n  10 2. **Local Requirements**\n  11    - Terraform installed: `brew install terraform` (Mac) or download from terraform.io\n  12    - SSH key pair: `ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 4096` if you don't have one\n  13    - Git installed\n  14 \n  15 3. **API Keys Required**\n  16    - Hetzner Cloud API token\n  17    - OpenClaw API key: https://openclaw.ai (for Moltbot AI features)\n  18    - OpenAI API key (optional): https://platform.openai.com/\n  19    - WordPress site URL (if using headless WordPress)\n  20 \n  21 ## \ud83d\ude80 Quick Start (YOLO Mode)\n  22 \n  23 ```bash\n  24 # 1. Clone your repository\n  25 git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ai-blog-platform.git\n  26 cd ai-blog-platform\n  27 \n  28 # 2. Configure Terraform\n  29 cp terraform/terraform.tfvars.example terraform/terraform.tfvars\n  30 nano terraform/terraform.tfvars  # Edit with your values\n  31 \n  32 # 3. Deploy everything\n  33 chmod +x scripts/deploy-hetzner.sh\n  34 ./scripts/deploy-hetzner.sh\n  35 ```\n  36 \n  37 ## \ud83d\udcdd Detailed Setup\n  38 \n  39 ### Step 1: Configure terraform.tfvars\n  40 \n  41 Edit `terraform/terraform.tfvars`:\n  42 \n  43 ```hcl\n  44 # Hetzner Cloud API Token (from Hetzner Console)\n  45 hcloud_token = \"your-hetzner-api-token\"\n  46 \n  47 # Server Configuration\n  48 server_type = \"cx22\"      # \u20ac5.83/month - 2 vCPU, 4GB RAM, 40GB SSD\n  49 location    = \"fsn1\"      # Germany (closest to Europe/Asia)\n  50 \n  51 # Your SSH public key path\n  52 ssh_public_key_path = \"~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub\"\n  53 \n  54 # Application Configuration\n  55 wordpress_api_url = \"https://your-wordpress-site.com/wp-json\"\n  56 openai_api_key    = \"sk-...\"           # OpenAI API key\n  57 anthropic_api_key = \"sk-ant-...\"       # Anthropic Claude API key\n  58 \n  59 # Site Configuration\n  60 site_url         = \"http://your-ip-or-domain.com\"\n  61 site_name        = \"My AI Blog\"\n  62 site_description = \"AI-powered content platform with OpenClaw Moltbot\"\n  63 \n  64 # Optional: Monetization\n  65 stripe_publishable_key = \"pk_test_...\"\n  66 ```\n  67 \n  68 ### Step 2: Deploy Infrastructure\n  69 \n  70 ```bash\n  71 cd terraform\n  72 terraform init\n  73 terraform plan\n  74 terraform apply\n  75 ```\n  76 \n  77 This creates:\n  78 - \u2705 Hetzner Cloud server (CX22 or your choice)\n  79 - \u2705 Firewall rules (SSH, HTTP, HTTPS)\n  80 - \u2705 10GB volume for persistent storage\n  81 - \u2705 Automated Docker deployment\n  82 - \u2705 Nginx reverse proxy\n  83 - \u2705 Auto-updates via cron\n  84 \n  85 ### Step 3: Get Server IP\n  86 \n  87 ```bash\n  88 terraform output server_ip\n  89 # Note this IP address\n  90 ```\n  91 \n  92 ### Step 4: Update next.config.js\n  93 \n  94 Update `next.config.js` to enable standalone mode for Docker:\n  95 \n  96 ```javascript\n  97 /** @type {import('next').NextConfig} */\n  98 const nextConfig = {\n  99   output: 'standalone',\n 100   images: {\n 101     unoptimized: true,\n 102   },\n 103   // ... rest of config\n 104 }\n 105 ```\n 106 \n 107 ### Step 5: Setup SSL (After DNS Configuration)\n 108 \n 109 ```bash\n 110 # SSH into your server\n 111 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 112 \n 113 # Run SSL setup script\n 114 cd /root/app\n 115 bash scripts/setup-ssl.sh yourdomain.com\n 116 ```\n 117 \n 118 ## \ud83d\udd27 Server Management\n 119 \n 120 ### SSH Access\n 121 ```bash\n 122 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 123 ```\n 124 \n 125 ### View Logs\n 126 ```bash\n 127 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 128 cd /root/app\n 129 docker compose logs -f        # Follow all logs\n 130 docker compose logs -f app    # Follow app logs only\n 131 ```\n 132 \n 133 ### Restart Services\n 134 ```bash\n 135 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 136 cd /root/app\n 137 docker compose restart        # Restart all\n 138 docker compose restart app    # Restart app only\n 139 ```\n 140 \n 141 ### Update Deployment\n 142 ```bash\n 143 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 144 bash /root/app/scripts/update.sh\n 145 ```\n 146 \n 147 ### Monitor System\n 148 ```bash\n 149 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 150 bash /root/app/scripts/monitor.sh\n 151 ```\n 152 \n 153 ### Backup\n 154 ```bash\n 155 ssh root@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n 156 bash /root/app/scripts/backup.sh\n 157 ```\n 158 \n 159 ## \ud83d\udcb0 Pricing\n 160 \n 161 ### Hetzner Cloud Costs\n 162 - **CX22** (recommended): \u20ac5.83/month - 2 vCPU, 4GB RAM, 40GB SSD\n 163 - **CX32**: \u20ac11.66/month - 4 vCPU, 8GB RAM, 80GB SSD  \n 164 - **CX42**: \u20ac23.31/month - 8 vCPU, 16GB RAM, 160GB SSD\n 165 \n 166 ### Additional Costs\n...\n 173 ## \ud83e\udd16 OpenClaw Moltbot Integration\n 174 \n 175 The platform integrates with **OpenClaw** (https://openclaw.ai) - an AI assistant platform powered by Claude that provides:\n 176 \n 177 - **Content generation and optimization** - Create high-quality blog posts\n 178 - **SEO recommendations** - Improve search rankings\n 179 - **Translation services** - Multi-language support\n 180 - **Content ideation** - Generate post ideas and outlines\n 181 - **Smart automation** - Email management, calendar, and more\n 182 \n 183 ### Configure OpenClaw API\n 184 \n 185 1. **Sign up at https://openclaw.ai**\n 186    - Connect via WhatsApp, Telegram, or other chat apps\n 187    - Get your API key from the dashboard\n 188 \n 189 2. **Add to `terraform/terraform.tfvars`:**\n 190    ```hcl\n 191    openclaw_api_key = \"your-openclaw-api-key\"\n 192    openclaw_api_url = \"https://api.openclaw.ai\"\n 193    ```\n 194 \n 195 3. **API Integration:**\n 196    - The helper library is at `src/lib/openclaw.ts`\n 197    - API routes in `src/app/api/ai/` use OpenClaw\n 198    - All AI features automatically use OpenClaw's Claude integration\n 199 \n 200 ### OpenClaw Features Available:\n 201 - Content generation via chat interface\n 202 - Automated email and calendar management\n 203 - Flight check-ins and travel assistance\n 204 - Multi-platform access (WhatsApp, Telegram, web)\n...\n 294 tar -xzf /backups/openclaw_moltbot_backup_TIMESTAMP.tar.gz\n...\n 339 ### Hetzner Support\n...\n 349 Your OpenClaw Moltbot-powered blog platform is now running on Hetzner Cloud! \n 350 \n 351 **Next Steps:**\n 352 1. Create your first blog post in WordPress\n 353 2. Test AI features at `/ai-tools`\n 354 3. Configure monetization (Stripe, affiliates)\n 355 4. Share your content!\n 356 \n 357 ---\n 358 \n 359 **Cost-effective, scalable, and AI-powered. Welcome to the future of blogging! \ud83d\ude80**\n 360 \n````", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01Fiq42HMzN5rkGfdivsX9EW", "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-02-03T09:19:42.667577+00:00", "part_kind": "tool-return"}
